@startuml
[*] --> Start

state "Start" as Start
Start : entry / start state

state "Registration" as Registration
Registration : entry / get registration details
Registration : do / validate registration details
Registration : exit / valid or invalid registration

Registration --> Login : [valid registration]

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / get login details
Login : do / validate login details
Login : exit / valid or invalid login

Login --> Choice1 : [valid login]

state "Choice1" <<choice>>
Choice1 : entry / choice made
Choice1 : do / apply for certificate or cancel
Choice1 : exit / certificate applied or cancelled

Choice1 --> ApplyForCert : [apply for certificate]
ApplyForCert : entry / get certificate details
ApplyForCert : do / validate certificate details
ApplyForCert : exit / valid or invalid certificate

ApplyForCert --> RequestCert : [valid certificate]

state "RequestCert" as RequestCert
RequestCert : entry / request certificate
RequestCert : do / send request to issuer
RequestCert : exit / request sent or failed

RequestCert --> CancelCert : [request failed]

state "CancelCert" as CancelCert
CancelCert : entry / cancel certificate
CancelCert : do / cancel request
CancelCert : exit / cancelled or failed

CancelCert --> Logout : [cancelled]

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / log out
Logout : do / end session
Logout : exit / logged out

Logout --> Start : [logged out]
@enduml
